    },
    {
      "id": "b000007",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 7,
      "end_line": 10,
      "raw": "- `InAppClipboardStore.*`: stores the current in-app resource snapshot.\n- `InAppClipboardManager.*`: imports clipboard or URL resources into `.wsresource` packages.\n- `ClipboardResourceImport.*`: builds import descriptors from captured formats.\n- `FiletypeCapture.*`: detects file type and MIME hints.\n",
